  "question": {
    "text": "The median of a set of <math><mn>9</mn></math> distinct observations is <math><mn>20.5</mn></math>. If each of the largest <math><mn>4</mn></math> observations of the set is increased by <math><mn>4</mn></math>, then the median of the new set",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Un3sS",
      "text": "is increased by <math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bQqC7",
      "text": "is decreased by <math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pNivG",
      "text": "is two times the original median",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "A3bZ9",
      "text": "remains the same as that of the original set",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msub></math> are the observations such that,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></math> i <math><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Median <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mo>∵</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msub></math> are increased by <math><mn>4</mn></math> hence, median <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math> remains the same.",
